  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Unknown vs By Advs.Sri.Madhu Radhakrishnan on 25 November, 2013 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Kemal Pasha Wednesday, The 17Th Day Of January 2018 / 27Th Pousha, 1939 Crl.MC.No. 6667 of 2016 Cc 1407/2014 of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court-V, Kozhikode. -------------- Petitioner/Accused 6 Tata Coffee Limited, A Company Incorporated Under The Provisions Of The Companies Act, 1956,Having Its Registered Office At, Pollibetta, South Kodagu, Madikeri District- 571 215. By Advs.Sri.Madhu Radhakrishnan Sri.Nelson Joseph Respondent/Complainant 1 Food Safety Officer, Beypore Circle, Kozhikode- 673 015. 2 State Of Kerala Represented By Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala. By Public Prosecutor Sri. Amjith Ali. This Criminal Misc. Case Having Been Finally Heard On 17-01-2018, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: Hr.... Crl.MC.No. 6667 of 2016 Unknown vs By Advs.Sri.Madhu Radhakrishnan on 25 November, 2013 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/48003658/ 1 Appendix Petitioner(S)' Annexures Annexure A1 True Copy Of The Complaint C.C.No.1407/2014 Filed By The Respondent Before The Jmfc-V, Kozhikode. Annexure A2 True Copy Of Central Excise Invoice No. 00287 Dated 25Th November, 2013. Annexure A3 True Copy Of The Bill Issue By Auctioneers, M/S Paramount Tea Marketing (Si) Pvt. Ltd. Annexure A4 Copy Of The Order Dated 19Th May, 2016 Passed By The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India. Respondent(S)' Annexures Nil // True Copy// P.S To Judge. Hr... B.Kemal Pasha, J. ====================== Crl.M.C.No.6667 of 2016 ======================= Dated this the 17th day of January, 2018 Order Petitioner is the 6th accused in C.C.No.1407 of 2014 of the Judicial First Class Magistrate's Court-V, Kozhikode, based on Annexure-A1 complaint alleging violation of the Food Safety and Standards Act",
